LeetCode #881 — Boats to Save People

Exact filename: BoatsToSavePeople.java

Algorithm
Sort the people array.
Keep left at the lightest person and right at the heaviest.
Every boat must take the heaviest remaining person.
If the lightest + heaviest fit within limit, put them together.
Otherwise, the heaviest person goes alone.
Count every boat used.

Time: O(n log n)
Space: O(log n) for sorting
